```
# Godot-specific ignores
*.import
*.uid
export_presets.cfg
.autoload_register
.editor
.godot/

# Dependencies
addons/*/node_modules/
addons/*/.venv/
addons/*/venv/
addons/*/.env
addons/*/.env.*

# Build artifacts
addons/*/dist/
addons/*/build/
addons/*/target/
addons/*/.gradle/

# Python artifacts (if any Python scripts in addons)
addons/*/__pycache__/
addons/*.pyc
addons/*.pyo
addons*/.mypy_cache/
addons*/.pytest_cache/

# Logs and temp files
addons/*.log
addons/*.tmp
addons/*.swp

# Editors
addons*/.vscode/
addons*/.idea/

# System files
addons*/.DS_Store
addons*/Thumbs.db
```